{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useParams"},{"type":"text","value":" method returns all of the path parameters that were parsed for the closest match and all of its parent matches."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"useparams-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useParams options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useParams"},{"type":"text","value":" hook accepts an optional "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-strict-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.strict"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional - "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"default: true"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":", the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.from"},{"type":"text","value":" option will be ignored and types will be loosened to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Partial<AllParams>"},{"type":"text","value":" to reflect the shared types of all params."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-shouldthrow-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.shouldThrow"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"default: true"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":","},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useParams"},{"type":"text","value":" will not throw an invariant exception in case a match was not found in the currently rendered matches; in this case, it will return "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-select-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.select"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"(params: AllParams) => TSelected"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If supplied, this function will be called with the params object and the return value will be returned from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useParams"},{"type":"text","value":". This value will also be used to determine if the hook should re-render its parent component using shallow equality checks."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"opts-structuralsharing-option","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"opts.structuralSharing"},{"type":"text","value":" option"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"../../guide/render-optimizations.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Render Optimizations guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for more information."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"useparams-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useParams returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An object of the match's and parent match path params or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSelected"},{"type":"text","value":" if a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select"},{"type":"text","value":" function is provided."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useParams } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst routeApi = getRouteApi('/posts/$postId')\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const params = useParams({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n\n  // OR\n\n  const routeParams = routeApi.useParams()\n\n  // OR\n\n  const postId = useParams({\n    from: '/posts/$postId',\n    select: (params) => params.postId,\n  })\n\n  // OR\n\n  const looseParams = useParams({ strict: false })\n\n  // ...\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"useparams-options","text":"useParams options","level":2},{"id":"opts-strict-option","text":"opts.strict option","level":3},{"id":"opts-shouldthrow-option","text":"opts.shouldThrow option","level":3},{"id":"opts-select-option","text":"opts.select option","level":3},{"id":"opts-structuralsharing-option","text":"opts.structuralSharing option","level":3},{"id":"useparams-returns","text":"useParams returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `useParams` method returns all of the path parameters that were parsed for the closest match and all of its parent matches.\n\n## useParams options\n\nThe `useParams` hook accepts an optional `options` object.\n\n### `opts.strict` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional - `default: true`\n- If `false`, the `opts.from` option will be ignored and types will be loosened to `Partial<AllParams>` to reflect the shared types of all params.\n\n### `opts.shouldThrow` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- `default: true`\n- If `false`,`useParams` will not throw an invariant exception in case a match was not found in the currently rendered matches; in this case, it will return `undefined`.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Optional\n- `(params: AllParams) => TSelected`\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the params object and the return value will be returned from `useParams`. This value will also be used to determine if the hook should re-render its parent component using shallow equality checks.\n\n### `opts.structuralSharing` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by `select`.\n- See the [Render Optimizations guide](../../guide/render-optimizations.md) for more information.\n\n## useParams returns\n\n- An object of the match's and parent match path params or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useParams } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst routeApi = getRouteApi('/posts/$postId')\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const params = useParams({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n\n  // OR\n\n  const routeParams = routeApi.useParams()\n\n  // OR\n\n  const postId = useParams({\n    from: '/posts/$postId',\n    select: (params) => params.postId,\n  })\n\n  // OR\n\n  const looseParams = useParams({ strict: false })\n\n  // ...\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useParamsHook\ntitle: useParams hook\n---\n\nThe `useParams` method returns all of the path parameters that were parsed for the closest match and all of its parent matches.\n\n## useParams options\n\nThe `useParams` hook accepts an optional `options` object.\n\n### `opts.strict` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional - `default: true`\n- If `false`, the `opts.from` option will be ignored and types will be loosened to `Partial<AllParams>` to reflect the shared types of all params.\n\n### `opts.shouldThrow` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- `default: true`\n- If `false`,`useParams` will not throw an invariant exception in case a match was not found in the currently rendered matches; in this case, it will return `undefined`.\n\n### `opts.select` option\n\n- Optional\n- `(params: AllParams) => TSelected`\n- If supplied, this function will be called with the params object and the return value will be returned from `useParams`. This value will also be used to determine if the hook should re-render its parent component using shallow equality checks.\n\n### `opts.structuralSharing` option\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- Configures whether structural sharing is enabled for the value returned by `select`.\n- See the [Render Optimizations guide](../../guide/render-optimizations.md) for more information.\n\n## useParams returns\n\n- An object of the match's and parent match path params or `TSelected` if a `select` function is provided.\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { useParams } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nconst routeApi = getRouteApi('/posts/$postId')\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const params = useParams({ from: '/posts/$postId' })\n\n  // OR\n\n  const routeParams = routeApi.useParams()\n\n  // OR\n\n  const postId = useParams({\n    from: '/posts/$postId',\n    select: (params) => params.postId,\n  })\n\n  // OR\n\n  const looseParams = useParams({ strict: false })\n\n  // ...\n}\n```\n"}
